<title>USA: LCC International posts charge for ETP buy.</title>
<headline>LCC International posts charge for ETP buy.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>LCC International Inc said on Thursday it expects to record an undisclosed one-time charge in its 1996 results related to the acquisition of European Technology Partner AS, or ETP, of Oslo, Norway.</p>
<p>LCC said it bought the net assets of ETP for an aggregate purchase price of $13.75 million. The acquisition closed on Dec. 30.</p>
<p>ETP develops network information and quality of service systems for mature wireless telecommunications operators. Its 1996 revenues were about $6.5 million, the company said.</p>
